{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>發佈時間：20:30 2026-09-06 HKT</p>\n\n<p>「百億富三代」鍾培生今年3月與「最年輕區議員」莊雅婷結婚，7月迎來愛女，升呢新手父母後不時在社交平台放閃。平時出入有司機、名車代步的鍾培生，近日竟罕有地乘搭港鐵，本想展現貼地一面，卻在黃竹坑站出閘機前出事，被老婆莊雅婷「詐型」。相中鍾培生身穿黑色西裝，站在閘機前，不停在銀包內找尋八達通，神態相當狼狽，令老婆莊雅婷不禁發文公審：「都唔明點解係都要用實體八達通！」</p>\n<h2>鍾培生被老婆詐型用實體八達通</h2>\n<p>莊雅婷其後再分享當天細節：「笑死！因為我等咗成分鐘，佢都未搵到張八達通！」她更將矛頭直指老公那不合時宜的「巨型銀包」，「佢個鬼死咁大嘅銀包已經bug咗我好耐，銀包大到條褲係咁跌，一啲美感都冇」。不過也有網民力撐鍾培生，指用八達通出閘時間，快過用手機的電子支付，而且若然手機無電，更是寸步難行。</p>\n<img alt=\"鍾培生豪言想「生夠6個」，會繼續「追仔」。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/1aa567d64cf6fe2876286eb590c03ff9/2026-07/Angel_3_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"鍾培生拍片承認莊雅婷已誕女，更揚言要求老婆「生五子一女」。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/03d70b972c662652944d157077816d16/2026-07/2_6_37.png\"/>\n<img alt=\"鍾培生言論被網民炮轟「大男人主義」、「不尊重女性」。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/b2c02208f7a2eb8345a8e3348708e070/2026-07/1_6_33.png\"/>\n<img alt=\"莊雅婷對建立大家庭似有所保留，卻被鍾培生爆金句：「生一個娶你返嚟做乜X嘢？」\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/24396284ba2be9de1eac41887b0f735b/2026-07/Angel_2_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"莊雅婷早前睇完醫生後去食街頭小食，又隔空與老公鍾培生耍花槍。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/6cbe83b2b1b0adc01b6316d9f6502c9c/2026-08/angel_5_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"莊雅婷曾在IG限時動態曝光夫妻對話截圖，透露已取得「新生嬰兒獎勵金」。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/2e3d20c42e64997d0e98381583443951/2026-08/angel_4_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"莊雅婷早前公開的IG限時動態，曝光月子餐食乜。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/6f763775551f9244f4729b3d4e519178/2026-08/angel_7_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"莊雅婷曾在IG限時動態為老公鍾培生護航。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/ec8396bad9685e8c6d3d553403204ba8/2026-07/Angel_5_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"鍾培生見到莊雅婷拍片，一度起身打招呼。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/7c2fbbf3e7a302951051dd65d716e75e/2026-07/Angel_7_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"莊雅婷稱鍾培生隻手「畀我捏到瘀晒」。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/987de2967eb7663b7fdbf267b0d8d221/2026-07/Angel_8_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"莊雅婷轉發鍾培生的影片，表示「6個係無可能」。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/444cf2eea6f1633629749ff0824d18d6/2026-07/Angel_4_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"鍾培生今年3月向「最年輕區議員」莊雅婷求婚成功。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/b290a25e49005c5ef7a92e90bcaf38a8/2026-03/642814659_18562790707029260_1675585603346574169_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"鍾培生以「電影級規格」打造求婚儀式。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/bdfbfa3d3a6c50d4d4e5260b47ff33f3/2026-03/640422144_18562790719029260_8517373388257856725_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"鍾培生與莊雅婷早前一同展示新婚戒指。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/1df8f347658f9b4b49e45d534943a42b/2026-03/angel_cnt_1774701933_3862801889343678633_1417343010.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"莊雅婷早前挺巨肚出席老公新店開幕活動。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/4833802081c900aece65d3f3f12aa99a/2026-07/015_2.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"莊雅婷已經坐月完畢。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/f25f73bbcb23f6f68a98c3143a279e56/2026-08/Angel_2_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"鍾培生與莊雅婷已開始向親友派薑醋。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/371aed2b0aad51966f5930390f8c83fe/2026-08/Angel_1_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"莊雅婷拍片老公鍾培生食雪條，被吸引想食埋一份。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/0b4cd5a66bedf68384f029819921f60e/2026-08/Liza_7_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"鍾培生曾接受網上節目《巴打圍爐》訪問，罕有大談婚姻生活，更首度公開與老婆莊雅婷的相識經過，原來全因鍾培生的「港姐情意結」！\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/4e838fea556a1e68cbc07dd5c2c40964/2026-07/VS--YouTube-L6-YouTube-0_00_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"鍾培生計劃十年要生五個仔，如果老婆莊雅婷不願意，他也要「夾硬嚟」。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/3fe20519901eddb56f136b916e189c3f/2026-07/VS--YouTube-L6-YouTube-34_14_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"被問到如果下胎也是女兒怎麼辦，鍾培生表示要繼續追仔，直到有五個兒子為止，表示：「咁咪生七個囉！」\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/cabf1327449106a14f33a6e2177d619a/2026-07/VS--YouTube-L6-YouTube-34_16_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"鍾培生的言論令主持人梁釗峰、陳家樂與KB都好驚訝。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/483f4225eed3c6b2cfe5ba852f606249/2026-07/VS--YouTube-L6-YouTube-34_20_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"鍾培生的言論意味著若「運氣不佳」一直生女兒，太太莊雅婷可能要生夠七個，甚至更多。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/42247387acf8ed523f811e59e4114e95/2026-07/VS--YouTube-L6-YouTube-34_29_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"鍾培生在節目中自爆，自己從小已是「香港小姐選舉」的忠實擁躉，可謂「屆屆都會睇」。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/379f4bcdb404f70ca2f977e3e75dcd05/2026-07/VS--YouTube-L6-YouTube-0_20_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"鍾培生一直有個習慣，就是會親自私訊（DM）心水佳麗留言加油打氣，去年他曾DM莊雅婷，繼而發展成戀人。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/3d4b06882006ce7b71038f086e5fde6b/2026-07/VS--YouTube-L6-YouTube-28_40_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"鍾培生笑言，當他私訊對方時，才翻查到原來女方早在16、17歲時，已經主動DM撩他傾偈搭訕，更視他為偶像。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/683d434d674cdbab6bbb34d66dd4b26b/2026-07/VS--YouTube-L6-YouTube-27_46_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"鍾培生傳宗接代態度強硬爆驚人金句：「生一個娶你返嚟做乜X嘢？」此話一出，足見這位百億富三代對傳宗接代的執著，同時引發網民熱烈討論。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/db98d5c94e9e4e47ab5927abb9dbf1c8/2026-07/VS--YouTube-L6-YouTube-27_57_.jpg\"/>\n<h2>鍾培生陪老婆搭港鐵爭取時間拍拖</h2>\n<p>莊雅婷雖然指老公鍾培生用實體八達通過時，但她之後分享了二人頭貼頭的合照，甜蜜地透露了鍾培生搭港鐵的真正原因。她寫道：「不過都幾好嘅，我話我去搭地鐵，佢又落車一齊搭地鐵，爭取時間拍下拖。」原來平時名車出入的鍾培生之所以會西裝筆挺出現在港鐵站，完全是為了陪伴老婆，網民大讚他不僅生活貼地，還是百分百的愛妻號。</p>\n<img alt=\"莊雅婷去年參選港姐，之後決定棄選。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/22eb384d5319ed3b60071454218acc87/2025-06/b9771aa2-d07c-475d-be21-dfd8c033cb0a_0.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"莊雅婷是名學霸。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/e8cad2e6a0d538e702293c903d9d2e85/2026-03/2_0_2.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"莊雅婷曾放棄入讀英國名牌大學。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/5fc40f2785da4af760f181469f25e55e/2026-03/1_11_2.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"莊雅婷是西貢區議員。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/fcfe52c67f744eea33543893ac224d0a/2026-03/3_2_2.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"莊雅婷這張照片，被網民指撞樣陳法拉。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/509cfb2365145d48e0df6ca668c31a6b/2026-03/7_0_1.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"莊雅婷於IG中拍下美態。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/fd47c85e036d954bb83e97065932eae3/2026-03/13_0_5.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"莊雅婷不時自拍影片講社會議題，豐滿身材屢成焦點。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/96e34e2772cc8b218b1af8dd3987de85/2026-03/8_0_1.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"莊雅婷熱愛運動。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/b45ca16c0369134211456c2cacc88a2a/2026-03/4_0_3.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"莊雅婷和朋友玩得不亦樂乎。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/71d731cd5194a384d06003d985cc94ff/2026-03/5_0_1.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"莊雅婷於IG以六字形容鍾培生。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/4b9b5078d514a63191479d29f919da9b/2026-03/6_2_1.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"鍾培生早前在社交平台貼上多張求婚的花絮相。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/afcebf48cb7a9d917b23cb56c09bfa04/2026-03/641735811_18562790743029260_1650709045458108639_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"鍾培生求婚動用不少人力、物力兼財力。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/fb6b5efb3524111707b4d5d9353a1c3e/2026-03/642161355_18562790761029260_4393151445530433858_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"條頸巾原來係鍾培生自己織。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/9d17a86e9cbd20b6a44d188816f06614/2026-03/640432514_18562790755029260_414646943061511138_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"鍾培生整個求婚企劃由專業電影導演團隊聯同動作特技組策劃。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/b102ac6f1ab3a6a82fe5479f8a615f7c/2026-03/641769237_18562790770029260_9199802657747435226_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"親身上陣的鍾培生更提前兩個月開始密集綵排。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/b8547b214182d4dd6729599eb371d288/2026-03/642799650_18562790788029260_1319210147069647933_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"反覆調整落地步伐與走位，務求整個過程萬無一失。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/56becdf50b1904f2876f1631ff63f5a2/2026-03/640450943_18562790797029260_4942653805741243258_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"網民對於鍾培生的求婚儀式，有讚亦有嘲笑。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/ecc11378926e93ee7f46897b15bb1e0f/2026-03/640469847_18562790815029260_7330435274931511207_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"親人在場見證。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/fd2456bce6dba9ad0da6c479f45a554c/2026-03/642970934_18562790824029260_5401359880372418297_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"有人問鍾培生：「鍾生你有時間有錢做乜咁睇唔開？」 鍾培生竟說：「相信愛情吖嘛。」\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/f569488c09af739227898dde5036a480/2026-03/641243302_18562790851029260_357520480420044737_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"鍾培生向未婚妻承諾：「我會愛你、保護你、照顧你一生一世。」\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/bbec6409f86c41b7ef0b8a3ebf6fac18/2026-03/640386811_18562790860029260_2512491444751721866_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"鍾培生的父親是豪華廈置業執行董事鍾仁偉。  ​\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/df3455dd9e569e4366f5a5d213b6328f/2023-03/khdcheung_275872336_724595302036223_5624826938785701028_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"鍾培生不時上載與父母的合照。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/a257e79eab969843721fba6f91577efa/2023-10/khdcheung_1671967631_3001004461108632608_755485259.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"鍾培生一向喜歡分享家中的名費物品如跑車。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/8114ca3aa45d82315a918a847f41480e/2023-03/khdcheung_134518460_702320143817145_4898529149269390304_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"鍾培生所住的豪宅，連天台地庫總共有5層。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/3f9662e54a196bcdb20f58eb7c239e12/2023-03/photo1677758803.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"鍾培生經常大晒富貴生活。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/1e64d9a1f53c72127b026f513ffbc7b2/2023-10/khdcheung_1659000546_2892228671890370841_755485259.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"不過都會親自下廚。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/6631ef37098f84ba9f3665848129819e/2023-10/khdcheung_1671885204_3000313012922796200_755485259.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"鍾培生曾上載展示1,000萬元現金的照片，指今年經濟不太好，想「spread more love」。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/f377dcc9cb717394f55252fd86c704d8/2024-02/khdcheung_1707125320_3295928529319871366_755485259.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"鍾培生以往亦曾與一大疊千元大鈔合照。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/d22790d9508670eb477d7e6a190092cc/2024-02/khdcheung_1687151831_3128378761267808913_755485259.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"鍾培生曾與羅家英到佐敦港鐵站派位位百元利是。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/3fdd075df2b4fd8ba959697e1c5fbf8a/2024-04/khdcheung_1708238877_3305269725952396473_755485259.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"鍾培生每次出戰都有很多不同浮誇造型。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/843cb91ed8548e38b0fca538c8ae7e0b/2023-10/khdcheung_1689148509_3145128112072570908_755485259.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"鍾培生除愛電競外，亦愛搞拳賽。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/a7217b8a9d2d2b1719d57ed81ff4058e/2023-10/khdcheung_1696247322_3204677274708032332_755485259.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"鍾培生近年多次搞《無敵盃》，邀得劉馬車、周永恆、霍哥及龍心等出戰。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/0833097e9ef8cd2cb01683115cb806e9/2023-10/khdcheung_1696247322_3204677274867469438_755485259.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"鍾培生連開記招都非常浮誇。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/64f2347e7c14901ae98ad4360cc5f1be/2023-10/130A6364.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"鍾培生搞的「培生擂台」不時掀起話題。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/740da733379fbb0c0b3b6f4d663ee14a/2023-12/Image_3_5.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"「百億富三代」鍾培生一向高調，不時在網上發表充滿話題性的議論。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/4822ff8c8e74dbd4f1160f02a24c4bf3/2023-10/01_26.png\"/>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-06T12:38:24.055174+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":538,"images":62,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none"}}